    "ASSUMPTION": "Identical HGB word risk, all observable raw/post OCR, token, lexical, map, geometry and risk groups, normalized two-count Ridge utility for all3 domains. Ridge/word admission selected on validation; reference is FIT all-DeepSolo F1. Freeze gate before selecting the shared post-fallback fusion grid. Admit fusion only when conditional paired-image bootstrap lower gain is positive; identity always eligible and fewer changed words preferred within0.1 points. Add larger explicitly predeclared quotas after initial TEST-exposed v1 failed. No TEST choice in this fit. Replace native FIT observations only by complete independently qualified conditional decoder-heldout banks, with full-FIT deployment experts on validation/TEST; same runtime model family for all3. New shared HGB two-count image regression family for all three datasets; same features, targets, word heads, decoder-heldout banks and finite validation-only selection. No extra neural model. Declared after v3 TEST failure; preserve adaptive exposure. Add the same64-D shared FIT-only PCA of existing frozen ResNet global mean/max activations in all3 image gates. No additional neural forward or network at runtime. Keep v5 image gates unchanged and add one shared pooled word-union classifier with equal domain weights; native decoder-heldout FIT only, protected RGB excluded. Identity versus8 cuts selected on fixed validation routes with the same conditional bootstrap rule. Uniform feature contract excludes DeepSolo recognition confidence in every domain because the ICDAR FIT caches lack it; retain qualified detector scores and explicit PARSeq sequence confidence. Preserve v6 pre-TEST cache-only study; qualify v6b against fresh-runtime metadata.",
